{"id":"de_claration","lemma":"déclaration","pos":"noun","rank":1654,"glosses":["declaration (written or oral indication of a fact, opinion, or belief)"],"ipa":"/de.kla.ʁa.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e2/Fr-d%C3%A9claration.ogg/Fr-d%C3%A9claration.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"déclarations"},"formAudio":{"déclarations":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/56/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-d%C3%A9clarations.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Cette déclaration est fausse.","en":"That statement is false.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"false","l":"faux"}]},{"text":"Je veux faire une déclaration.","en":"I want to make a statement.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Le président a fait une déclaration sur le sujet.","en":"The president made a statement on the issue.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"president"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"subject, topic"}]},{"text":"Je doute de la véracité de sa déclaration.","en":"I doubt the veracity of his statement.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"doubt"},null,null,{"g":"veracity"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"Une déclaration en douanes est requise.","en":"A customs declaration is required.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"customs","l":"douane"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"required","l":"requis"}]}]}